    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiikolile sha ng'wa Mika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho munhū ūmò lina lyakwe Mika walī wa mu sī ya magūlya ga Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo akang'wīla nina gīkī, “Mayū ī kilo ikūmi na idatū ja feza ījo ūkajimīīja, nūūkwigwa wahaya na mihayo ya kūzuma, nalī najo; naalī naajisola nene.” Hūna ū nina ūhaya, “SEEBA akwinhe ng'wana wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wajishosha ī kilo ikūmi n'idatū ja feza jenījo ū kūlī nina, ū nina ūhaya, “Naajīnja ī feza jane ū mu nkono gwane naajifunya kūlī SEEBA kūlwa nguno ya ng'witūnja wane, jibeejiwe shiikolile sha kūsula na shiikolile sha kwaabya. Na lūūlū leka nakūshokeje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wajishosha ū kūlī nina ī feza jenījo, ū nina wīnja ho kilo ibīlī na nusu ū mu feza jenījo ūjitwaala kūlī nsuji; ū nsuji ng'wenūyo ūbeeja shiikolile sha kūsula na shiikolile sha kwaabya, shūūtūūlwa mu numba ya ng'wa Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mika ng'weenūyo walī na iduku lya kwitongelegeja, waalī wabeeja na līīshiikolile ilebe; na walī nago maashikolo gangī ga kūlamiwa, ūntūūla būgabīji ūmò wa bitūnja bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo a Baisilaeli baalī batī na ntemi, būlī ng'wene wīītaga gīt'ūmo walī atogelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsūmba nebe ūmò wa Balawī, muna Betelehemu ya Yuda; wikalaga na banhū balebe ba mu ndūgū ja Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akīnga ū mu nzengo ūyo wikalaga, ūja akūkoobaga ipandī līngī lya kwikala. Aho alī mu kūbīta bīta gīko, ūshika a ha ng'wa Mika ū kū magūlya ga mu sī ya Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mika ūmūūja, “Ū bebe ūfumile halī?” Nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Nalī Nnawī nafumile Betelehemu ya Yuda, nalīīkooba ipandī lya kwikala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mika ūng'wīla, “Ikalaga hamò naane aha ūbize baba na ngabīji wa ha ng'wane. Nakūyūūkwinha gulaamu igana n'ikūmi ja feza būlī ng'waka, na shizwalo sha kūzwaala nī shilīwa sha kūlya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Nnawī ng'wenūyo ūzunya ū kwikala nang'hwe; nīyo ū sūmba ng'wenūyo ūbiza gītī ūmò wa bitūnja ba ng'wa Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mika ūntūūla ū sūmba ng'wenūyo, ū Naawī ha nīmo gwa būgabīji wa ha ng'wakwe, ūbiza ng'wikaji wa henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mika ūhaya, “Ī haha lūūlū nalībona gīkī ū SEEBA akūnīītīla yawiza, nguno naapandīkaga Nnawī kūbiza ngabīji a ha ng'wane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
